+| Contract | [V025-CONTROLLER-PIPELINE-CONTRACT-2026-09-10.md](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-astra-ws/controller-records/V025-CONTROLLER-PIPELINE-CONTRACT-2026-09-10.md) |
+| Training declaration | [V025-CONTROLLER-PREDECLARATION-FIRST-TRAINING-2026-09-10.md](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-astra-ws/controller-records/V025-CONTROLLER-PREDECLARATION-FIRST-TRAINING-2026-09-10.md) |
